      ['g05', 'Mouse', 'heavy', 0.84, `${C.ganesha} looks down at his ride, a tiny mouse, sitting at his feet on Mount Kailash, as a peacock disappears into the far sky.`,
        'Ganesha looked at his ride. A tiny mouse. A big body, and a small mouse. He could never win that race.'],
      ['g06', 'World', 'grand', 0.88, `${C.kartikeya} on his peacock flies fast over oceans, mountains, forests and deserts, the curve of the earth below.`,
        'Kartikeya flew over oceans, mountains, forests and deserts… faster, and faster.'],
      ['g07', 'Thinking', 'quiet', 0.82, `${C.ganesha} sits calmly on a rock on Mount Kailash, eyes half closed, thinking, his mouse beside him.`,
        'Ganesha sat quietly. He did not panic. He thought.'],
      ['g08', 'Circle', 'devotional', 0.84, `${C.ganesha} walks with folded hands in a circle around his parents ${C.shiva} and ${C.parvati}, who sit together on Mount Kailash; faint footprints mark the circle around them.`,
        'Then he stood up, folded his hands… and slowly walked around his parents. Once. Twice. Three times.'],
      ['g09', 'Why?', 'wonder', 0.84, `${C.shiva} and ${C.parvati} look at ${C.ganesha} with curious smiles, asking him something.`,
        'Why did you do that? they asked.'],
      ['g10', 'My world', 'sacred', 0.82, `${C.ganesha} stands before his parents ${C.shiva} and ${C.parvati} with folded hands, and behind the parents the whole earth, sun and stars are drawn faintly, as if they hold the world.`,
        'Ganesha said: you are my whole world. Everything I am comes from you. So I have gone around the world.'],
      ['g11', 'Wisdom', 'joyful', 0.86, `${C.parvati} places the shining golden fruit in the hands of ${C.ganesha}, while ${C.shiva} smiles proudly.`,
        'Shiva and Parvati smiled… and gave him the fruit.'],
      ['g12', 'Too late', 'pained', 0.82, `${C.kartikeya} lands on his peacock, tired and proud, and sees ${C.ganesha} already holding the golden fruit; his face falls, hurt and angry.`,
        'When Kartikeya came back, tired and proud… the fruit was already gone. He was hurt. And angry.'],
      ['g13', 'Palani', 'quiet', 0.82, `${C.kartikeya} sits alone on top of a green hill in the south, and ${C.shiva} and ${C.parvati} climb up the hill to comfort him.`,
        'The story goes that he went away to a hill in the south, Palani, to be alone. And his parents went to him there… because they loved him just as much.'],
      ['g14', 'Both', 'warm', 0.86, `${C.shiva} and ${C.parvati} sit with both sons together again, ${C.ganesha} and ${C.kartikeya} smiling at each other, the mouse and the peacock beside them.`,
        'Both sons were loved. One was fast. One was wise. Neither was less.'],
      ['g15', 'Matters', 'hopeful', 0.84, `Close view of ${C.ganesha} smiling gently, holding the golden fruit, his mouse on his shoulder.`,
        'Ganesha did not win because he was faster. He won… because he saw what mattered most.'],
      ['diya', 'Even mind', 'peace', 0.8, null,
        'Krishna says in the Gita… Do your work steady in yourself. Be the same in success and in failure. That evenness… is called yoga.']
